# The store is text on purpose — that is the whole reason SVG/HTML source is committed and PNG
# rasters are not. Text only pays off if `git diff` is readable, so nothing here may be
# normalised into a whole-file rewrite on a machine with different line endings.
*.svg   text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
index.jsonl text eol=lf
*.png   binary
